00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.690
So high-performance
user experience.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:18.440
What we do is our protocol
provides the highest image

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.840
quality with efficient
build-to-lossless

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.550
So what that means
is, when you're

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:26.840
