we offer with our technology.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:38.240
And also, ease of
deployment and management.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:43.610
We understand that, if you're
managing virtual workstations,

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.730
you want to make sure that
you can do that efficiently

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:47.570
