00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:07.290
This means any public cloud,
on-premises, mix of those.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:10.070
Whatever suits your
needs we can do.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.820
So I haven't said yet what
