00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:46.230
So let's say you do
virtualize your workstations.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:50.670
And if you do, you need a way
to efficiently manage them.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.560
And there's reasons
why you might

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:54.840
