and obviously save time

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.730
and money to manage your users.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:01.050
What we offer is a Cloud
Access Manger service for you

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:03.300
to be able to do
this, and this is what

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.000
