00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:10.080
And some of the features and
capabilities that it gives you

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:13.320
is that it improves
administrative efficiency

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.650
because it automatically
provisions your workstations

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:17.250
for you.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.625
So you don't have to manually
go through a bunch of steps

00:15:19.625 --> 00:15:20.700
to do it.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:21.670
You can scale easily.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:24.210
You can add more workstations,
remove workstations,

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.010
scale up and down easily.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:30.120
And third one on there is about
managing cloud consumption

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.140
