00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:32.740
So that's a big thing.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.560
If you are using a
public cloud and you're

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:42.567
using the OpEx
versus CapEx model,

00:15:42.567 --> 00:15:45.150
you don't want to be paying for
something you're not currently

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.060
