00:27:10.290 --> 00:27:13.990
Just kind of shows the
capabilities of the GPU

00:27:13.990 --> 00:27:15.502
very quick.

00:27:15.502 --> 00:27:16.710
So that's really neat to see.

00:27:20.398 --> 00:27:21.320
Cool.

00:27:21.320 --> 00:27:23.780
So how do we make this happen?

00:27:23.780 --> 00:27:27.010
So I'm going to log into the
