00:27:27.010 --> 00:27:29.350
It's at cam.teradici.com.

00:27:29.350 --> 00:27:31.340
Today, I'm actually
showing you our beta UI,

00:27:31.340 --> 00:27:33.880
and that's why it's
represented in the URL.

00:27:33.880 --> 00:27:37.480
We support different
identity providers to log in.

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:39.430
We support Microsoft and Google.

00:27:39.430 --> 00:27:42.940
Since we're at Google Next, I'm
