00:29:50.250 --> 00:29:52.763
I know there's NVIDIA machines.

00:29:52.763 --> 00:29:54.180
I've already set
up my networking,

00:29:54.180 --> 00:29:55.890
so I'm just going to
select my network.

00:29:55.890 --> 00:29:57.660
I'll just choose that one.

00:29:57.660 --> 00:30:00.788
And then, machine type, you
can select different types.

00:30:00.788 --> 00:30:02.580
And then, here are the
different GPU types.

00:30:02.580 --> 00:30:07.200
So today in this region, I
