00:30:11.493 --> 00:30:13.410
And once that becomes
available in the region,

00:30:13.410 --> 00:30:17.040
it will automatically show
up in our interface here.

00:30:17.040 --> 00:30:19.680
So I'll just select a
P4, and you can select

00:30:19.680 --> 00:30:22.640
how many GPUs you would like.

00:30:22.640 --> 00:30:27.490
And then, just I have to
enter in my AD credentials.

00:30:27.490 --> 00:30:29.460
This is service
account credentials,

00:30:29.460 --> 00:30:31.450
so I'll just do it quickly.

00:30:39.773 --> 00:30:41.490
Got that right.

00:30:41.490 --> 00:30:44.510
And then, I'm going
to get hit Create.

00:30:44.510 --> 00:30:46.470
So while it's going
