00:30:46.470 --> 00:30:48.870
I'm just going to go and show
you the view of the Remote

00:30:48.870 --> 00:30:49.890
Workstations page.

00:30:49.890 --> 00:30:51.640
So these are the three
remote workstations

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:53.730
I've previously set
up as well as the one

00:30:53.730 --> 00:30:56.640
that's being created right now.

00:30:56.640 --> 00:30:58.410
So you can see they're running.

00:30:58.410 --> 00:31:01.320
With most virtual workstations
you might be familiar with,

00:31:01.320 --> 00:31:04.650
you can start, stop, restart,
and delete them, as well as

00:31:04.650 --> 00:31:05.310
