00:31:05.310 --> 00:31:07.710
I'm just going to edit one,
just to quickly show you.

00:31:07.710 --> 00:31:11.520
Here is all my users in my AD.

00:31:11.520 --> 00:31:18.030
So I can assign Ryan Meadows and
Adam, add him to this list such

00:31:18.030 --> 00:31:20.460
that when he logs in
with his AD credentials

00:31:20.460 --> 00:31:23.190
he'll be presented with
this remote workstation

00:31:23.190 --> 00:31:24.750
so this person can go access it.

00:31:28.120 --> 00:31:30.730
One thing I want to
mention, this whole frontend

00:31:30.730 --> 00:31:35.140
that you're seeing is
using our backend APIs,

00:31:35.140 --> 00:31:37.690
and we plan to make those
