00:32:43.900 --> 00:32:44.950
That's in the stop state.

00:32:44.950 --> 00:32:45.680
Yes, it is.

00:32:45.680 --> 00:32:46.180
OK.

00:32:46.180 --> 00:32:48.460
So I'm just going
to go connect to it,

00:32:48.460 --> 00:32:50.370
establish a PCoIP connection.

00:32:53.590 --> 00:32:56.560
So back in the client, it
